      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Celebrate the artists, creators and industry leaders shaping Ottawa’s music scene at the 2026 Capital Music Awards, live from the National Arts Centre.\n\nThe Capital Music Awards are a marquee event of Capital Music Week, presented by the Ottawa Music Industry Coalition (OMIC). Running October 2–10, the nine-day celebration brings together 100+ artists across 20+ venues throughout Ottawa, with live shows, showcases, industry events, networking, film, nightlife and the national Canada After Dark summit.\n\nHosted by Tyler Shaw and Kellylee Evans, the..."
