    "http://ogp.me/ns#title": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Ray Chen in recital | Great Performers Series |  Sun, Oct 18, 2026, 8:00 pm | Southam Hall"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#image": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "https://naccnaca-eventimages.s3.amazonaws.com/40677/9169_nac_naco_26_27_batch2_3__large.jpg"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "A few things to know ...\n\n\n\tViolinist Ray Chen—called “the epitome of cool” by the Sydney Morning Herald— returns to Southam Hall to calm the mind and stir the soul with a program spanning 200 years.\n\tEven if you’ve never seen him perform, Chen may look familiar: He’s appeared in the hit series Mozart in the Jungle, modelled for Giorgio Armani, and was profiled in Vogue.\n\n\nWhether he’s performing on the world’s biggest stages or sharing the magic of classical music with two..."
      }
    ],
